{
  "id": "dsh-infra",
  "name": "@local/dsh-infra",
  "displayName": "Assets · 个人资产面板",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "repo": "https://github.com/ChrisZqaq/dsh-infra",
  "repoPath": "dsh-infra",
  "entry": "index.js",
  "clientEntry": "client.js",
  "bundlePatch": "cordis.patch.yml",
  "hostDirs": [
    "host"
  ],
  "localeDirs": [
    "locale"
  ],
  "docs": [
    "README.md",
    "examples/assets.example.yml"
  ],
  "install": "github:ChrisZqaq/dsh-infra",
  "update": "dsh plugin --profile desktop add github:ChrisZqaq/dsh-infra",
  "verify": "node scripts/verify.mjs",
  "slots": [
    "sidebar.footer.action",
    "main"
  ],
  "routes": [
    "GET /dsh-infra/assets",
    "POST /dsh-infra/assets",
    "GET /dsh-infra/snapshots",
    "POST /dsh-infra/github/sync"
  ],
  "services": [],
  "notes": [
    "数据在仓外：~/.dsh/infra/assets.yml（当前状态，可手改）+ ~/.dsh/infra/snapshots.jsonl（只追加快照）。两个文件都不进 git。",
    "宿主只 inject webServer + subprocess，不注入 prompt、不拦截命令、不扫 ~/.ssh。",
    "负债填正数，面板按 kind 加负号；快照同时存汇率与合计，改汇率不回算历史。",
    "仓库同步跑 gh repo list --limit 300，只覆盖 name/visibility/language/committedAt/description/remote，保留本地 note。"
  ]
}
